{"id": "Der26qADV2G", "title": "Video by capyember", "description": "6 enemies in my game share the exact same code \ud83e\uddab Only their numbers and animations change.\n\nThe trick is reusable components: small pieces that each do one thing. A health node that stores health, subtracts damage and fires a signal when it runs out. Another that takes hits, another that deals damage on touch, another that drops experience. Each one is tiny and knows nothing about the enemy.\n\nSo making a new enemy is like building with Lego: drop in the components, hook up health, tweak the numbers, and I only work on the animations. Today 76 enemies in Capy of Gods use the same health component.\n\nWishlist it and play the free demo right now on Steam (link in bio).\n\n#CapyOfGods #gamedev #godot #godotengine #indiedev #solodev #gamedevtips #pixelart #roguelike", "channel": "capyember", "uploader_id": "37003530640", "uploader": "Francisco Alvial", "timestamp": 1792433189, "like_count": 1439, "comment_count": 31, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18104785349234641a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 87.469, "asr": 96000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNwr5xiAptibjOucf_aGi4HFTK-4BVup3NcI8Jd9KLdexxYraCgvNXTbpBIHccsIvjLkXUTrvLeMhfKJDa_cOVaPncogDcxEpNO_bU.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=4kT3JPboa30Q7kNvwHgVWyL&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=PUTmbBP8cLx1c5KHUOIpQQ&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&